			<p>The New Irish Historical Agency was founded in 1967 by a group historians, archivists, and
				historical enthusiasts</p>
			<p>Over the many decades we have expanded our archives, worked with schools and universities to bring
				Irish history to thousands of people.</p>
			<p>We are an independent institution funded by state grants, public donations, and partnerships.</p>
			<p>Our commitment is to real history, the way it happened.</p>
